{"meta":{"description":"Smokejumpers Grill serves burgers, sandwiches, fries and more in Grizzly Peak at Disney California Adventure Park in Southern California.","keywords":"smokejumpers grill, dining, restaurant, burgers, sandwiches, food, drinks, american food","title":"Smokejumpers Grill | Dining | Disneyland Resort"},"id":"354483;entityType=restaurant","theme":"hyperion","entityTypeUrl":"/dining/#/","type":"restaurant","contentService":"explorer","themeData":{"finder":"hyperion"},"aagData":{"type":"restaurant","title":"Smokejumpers Grill","location":"Disney California Adventure Park","admissionRequired":{"title":"Valid Ticket and Park Reservation for Same Park on Same Date Required"},"description":"Extinguish your hunger with fiery favorites hot off the grill at this spacious and scenic casual eatery.","media":{"desktop":"https://cdn1.parksmedia.wdprapps.disney.com/resize/mwImage/1/1600/900/75/vision-dam/digital/parks-platform/parks-global-assets/disneyland/dining/smokejumpers-grill/DLR_DCA_SmokejumpersGrill_DoubleCheeseburger_10162025_DSC01395DN-16x9.jpg?2026-03-16T18:34:21+00:00","mobile":"https://cdn1.parksmedia.wdprapps.disney.com/resize/mwImage/1/630/354/75/vision-dam/digital/parks-platform/parks-global-assets/disneyland/dining/smokejumpers-grill/DLR_DCA_SmokejumpersGrill_DoubleCheeseburger_10162025_DSC01395DN-16x9.jpg?2026-03-16T18:34:21+00:00","media":"(max-width: 768px)","alt":"A double cheeseburger next to a pile of french fries "},"breadcrumb":{"template":"Located in {link} at {link}","data":[{"label":"Grizzly Peak","link":"/destinations/disney-california-adventure/grizzly-peak/","title":"Go to  Grizzly Peak"},{"label":"Disney California Adventure Park","link":"/destinations/disney-california-adventure/","title":"Go to  Disney California Adventure Park"}]},"facetGroups":[{"name":"cuisine","icon":"dining","facets":[{"name":"American","urlFriendlyId":"american-cuisine","url":"/dining/#/american-cuisine","isClickable":false},{"name":"Mobile Orders","urlFriendlyId":"mobile-orders","url":"/dining/#/mobile-orders","isClickable":false},{"name":"Quick Service","urlFriendlyId":"quick-service","url":"/dining/#/quick-service","isClickable":false}]}],"accessibilityModal":{"data":[{"title":"Accessibility","data":[{"size":"m","text":"Guest May Remain in Wheelchair/ECV"}],"variant":"icon"},{"title":"Guest Policies","data":{"bulleted":[{"text":"<p><span>Alcoholic beverages may be purchased at the Disneyland Resort by Guests 21 years of age or older. The documents required to verify age vary for United States residents and non-United States residents.</span></p><p><strong><br />United States Residents</strong></p><p>United States residents who wish to purchase an alcoholic beverage at the Disneyland Resort must present one of the following forms of identification:</p><p>•        Identification card issued by a governmental agency in the United States (Federal, State, Territory,* County, City) that contains the following:</p><p>o   Name</p><p>o   Date of birth</p><p>o   Physical description of the person</p><p>o   Photo of the person</p><p>o   Expiration date</p><p>•        Valid active United States Armed Forces ID (must include date of birth and portrait photo)</p><p>•        Valid original passport</p><p>Temporary driver’s licenses, temporary ID cards and copies of passports, driver’s licenses or ID cards are not acceptable.</p><p>* United States territories include Puerto Rico, Guam, Northern Mariana Islands, United States Virgin Islands and American Samoa.</p><p><strong><br />Non-United States Residents</strong></p><p>Original passports are the only form of identification acceptable for Guests from outside the United States; non-United States driver’s licenses, ID cards, temporary ID cards and copies of ID cards are not acceptable.</p>"}],"icon":[]},"variant":"combined"}],"title":"Safety, Accessibility and Guest Policies","ctaTitle":"Show  Safety, Accessibility and Guest Policies","ariaLabel":"Open Modal for Safety, Accessib